                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Bells With a\nPurpose",
                                  "The red shelf\ncontains watch\nbells, door bells,\nand one bell\nlabeled",
                                  "NO PURPOSE YET.\nMoxie refuses to\ndiscard it. A\nuseful thing can\nwait",
                                  "for a useful job,\nshe says. It need\nnot become a\nsouvenir simply",
                                  "because the\ninvoice is tidy."
